Today I go to a shop after the office.
This is a clothing shop.
This shop is right in my area.
This shop is very big and bright.
Currently, there is a lot of heat in Mumbai.
I always wear light clothes in the summer.
I want new cotton clothes now.
There is a young salesman in the shop.
I say to him, "Dada, hello."
He says, "Hello Madam, come in."
I say, "I want light cotton clothes."
"I wear cotton clothes in the office."
"Show me good clothes."
Dada says, "Yes Madam, certainly."
"We have very good cotton clothes."
He shows me a big section.
There are very beautiful and colorful clothes there.
Some clothes are large and some clothes are small.
All these clothes are cotton and soft.
I happily look at these new clothes.
